    "id": "S09-E01",
    "topic": "FV translation",
    "answer": "future_value = principal * (1 + rate) ** periods. Addition forms the per-period factor, exponentiation compounds, multiplication scales by principal. The = symbol binds the result to the name (assignment statement); parentheses group the addition, and are not an arithmetic operator.",
    "source": "books/book-01-python-foundations-for-financial-mathematics/chapter-01/1.09-expressions-precedence-and-mathematical-translation.md",
    "source_sha256": "94bc04bcf6266a1cee79f3906a86e31e02deb98c6d5993170b64d7a085f7e5ee",
